#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: nicepay-payment-gateway.php
msgid "NicePay Payment Gateway"
msgstr "NicePay 결제 게이트웨이"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: nicepay-payment-gateway.php
msgid "https://github.com/cemililik/nicepay-paymentgateway-wordpress-plugin"
msgstr "https://github.com/cemililik/nicepay-paymentgateway-wordpress-plugin"

#. Description of the plugin
#: nicepay-payment-gateway.php
msgid ""
"NicePay Payment Gateway integration for WooCommerce. Payment methods remain "
"disabled until explicitly configured and validated."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce를 위한 NicePay 결제 게이트웨이 통합. 결제 방법은 명시적으로 구성"
"되고 검증될 때까지 비활성화된 상태로 유지됩니다."

#. Author of the plugin
#: nicepay-payment-gateway.php
